---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with the The Finance Verdict team."
>
  <section class="container-article py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy-deep tracking-tight">
      Contact.
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mt-6">
      <p>
        We read everything that comes in. Use the address that matches your reason for
        writing — replies are faster that way.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — <a href="mailto:corrections@thefinanceverdict.com">corrections@thefinanceverdict.com</a>. Found a wrong price, outdated feature, or factual error? We fix within 5 business days and note the correction at the top of the article.</li>
        <li><strong>Tips and product launches</strong> — <a href="mailto:tips@thefinanceverdict.com">tips@thefinanceverdict.com</a>. New tool we should review? Pricing or product change we missed?</li>
        <li><strong>Partnerships and PR</strong> — <a href="mailto:partnerships@thefinanceverdict.com">partnerships@thefinanceverdict.com</a>. Affiliate inquiries, brand partnership questions. We do not run sponsored reviews.</li>
        <li><strong>General questions</strong> — <a href="mailto:hello@thefinanceverdict.com">hello@thefinanceverdict.com</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-sm text-caution">
        We aim to respond within 5 business days. We do not give personal financial advice
        over email — for advice tailored to your situation, talk to a licensed advisor,
        CPA, or attorney.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
